		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Large house cat with two tails, spawned from a cat that lived beyond its years. Thrives on causing discord.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +3 (1d6 + disease) or create undead, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Create Undead</strong>. 3/day, lick dead body, rises as skeletal champion or juju zombie.</p><p></p><p><strong>Disease</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of the last mortal nekomata bit.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
